OL,3,GNEWSABoxing world hails 'trailblazer'
OL,4,AKatie Taylor ahead of Dublin swansong
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article was first published in
OL,7,FJune 2026. It has been republished on 5
OL,8,FSeptember with fresh interviews and
OL,9,Fmaterial
OL,11,FThe boxing world is coming together to
OL,12,Fcelebrate the end of Katie Taylor's
OL,13,Fglittering career.
OL,15,FHer long-awaited farewell fight against
OL,16,FFlora Pili in Croke Park, Dublin, takes
OL,17,Fplace on Saturday night, with 80,000
OL,18,Fpeople set to cram into Ireland's
OL,19,Fbiggest stadium for the two-time
OL,20,Fundisputed light-welterweight
OL,21,Fchampion's swansong.
OL,23,APub: 05-JunQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
