OL,4,AKatie Taylor ahead of Dublin swansong
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaylor's final fight has united fans,
OL,7,Fbut there are those on the island of
OL,8,FIreland who have a personal connection
OL,9,Fto the County Wicklow fighter and will
OL,10,Fbe reflecting on her impact on the
OL,11,Ffight game, especially for women.
